      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرِيصَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A certain small reptile</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَابَّةٌ صَغِيرَةٌ</span>),
<i>smaller than the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَزَغَة</span>; <i>when it bites a thing, the
latter is not cured.</i> (M, TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُرْصٌ</span>;
and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَامُّ أَبْرَصَ</span>, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْرَصُ</span>.]

